-  helm
-  lainapp
'  helmapp: the demo application bundle.  One compilation walks the
'  whole chain once — helm and lainapp share their sept/shrine/lain
'  imports through the diamond cache, so shells and tests that need
'  both pay a single compile.
+  helmapp_ok
  '  The bundle marker; the argument is ignored.
  \  x=nat
  ^  nat
  1
